Scoped median video filter

The option table, pixel-format list, radius clipping (check_params), the percentile
threshold, the per-plane mask and the eight-bit column-histogram median in
src/video-median.ts and src/video-ops/median.ts follow libavfilter/vf_median.c
(options, pix_fmts, check_params, config_input, filter_slice, filter_frame) and
libavfilter/median_template.c (filter_plane, DEPTH 8) with libavfilter/median.h.
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
